  "summary": "Cell C8 reads every daily file from 1991-12-27 to 2003-01-05 and from 2020-06-01 to 2020-08-31; C6 read the same dates and printed no read errors, so the NaN fallback was not triggered. It builds per-cell hazen 90th-percentile thresholds from the \u00b15-day pools and smooths them with a wrapping 31-day mean. Only the smoothed thresholds for target day-of-year 153\u2013244 are used, which draw on unsmoothed days 138\u2013259 and hence on baseline values from 12 May to 20 Sep of each year. Those thresholds are compared with all 92 target days for every sea cell, followed by run detection and gap joining, and the result is written to output/mhw_mask.nc."
